Private Sub Form_Activate()
Center Me

If Geld >= 500000 Then Command7.Enabled = True
If Geld >= 250000 Then Command6.Enabled = True
If Geld >= 150000 Then Command5.Enabled = True
If Geld >= 100000 Then Command4.Enabled = True
If Geld >= 75000 Then Command3.Enabled = True
If Geld >= 50000 Then Command2.Enabled = True



End Sub

